Chapter: SweepAppsScript

  cites Foreword chapter Console
  cites Foreword chapter Maybe
  cites Shell chapter ShellTypes
  cites Shell chapter ShellBuild
  cites Shell chapter Pipeline
  cites Shell chapter PowerShellEmit

 We say:

 THE TENTH GENERATOR ON THE PIPELINE MODEL (PipelineModel.md). The emitted
 script is byte-identical to the one that shipped before the migration.

 THE SUMMARY STAGE'S VERDICT IS EMPTY AND THAT IS NOT AN OVERSIGHT: this script
 exits with `crash + timeout`, a COMPUTED code, and `PipeOutcome` can spell a
 literal (`PoExit`) or a child's own code (`PoPassthrough`) and nothing else.
 Declaring a number here would be false. That is the second time the verdict
 vocabulary has come up short, so it is recorded on the design page as one
 decision for the second pass rather than answered with a third constructor
 added on the spot.

Section: Parameters

  sweep-params : List ShellParam = [sh-param-default "Dir" SptString (SeLit "games"), sh-param-default "TimeoutSec" SptInt (SeInt 60)]

Section: The pipeline, declared before it is spelled

  repo-art : PipeArtifact = PipeArtifact { pa-name = "Repo", pa-kind = PkDir, pa-expr = SeVar "Repo", pa-from = Just (SePathResolve (SePathJoin SeScriptRoot (SeLit ".."))) }

  compile-script-art : PipeArtifact = PipeArtifact { pa-name = "CompileScript", pa-kind = PkFile, pa-expr = SeVar "CompileScript", pa-from = Just (SePathJoin SeScriptRoot (SeLit "compile.ps1")) }

 `stage0` IS THE KERNEL THE SWEEP COMPILES WITH, and this stage copies the
 DEPOT SEED over it before any compile runs. `build-output\bare-metal\Codex.cdx`
 otherwise holds whichever compiler ran last, so the copy is what makes the
 sweep a statement about the seed (OperatorsManual, "Pass -Kernel when you do").

  stage0-art : PipeArtifact = PipeArtifact { pa-name = "stage0", pa-kind = PkFile, pa-expr = SeVar "stage0", pa-from = Just (SePathJoin (SeVar "Repo") (SeLit "build-output\\bare-metal\\Codex.cdx")) }

  seed-cdx-art : PipeArtifact = PipeArtifact { pa-name = "seedCdx", pa-kind = PkFile, pa-expr = SeVar "seedCdx", pa-from = Just (SePathJoin (SeVar "Repo") (SeLit "seed\\Codex.cdx")) }

  out-dir-art : PipeArtifact = PipeArtifact { pa-name = "outDir", pa-kind = PkDir, pa-expr = SeVar "outDir", pa-from = Just (SePathJoin (SeVar "Repo") (SeConcat (SeLit "build-output\\sweep-") (pipe-param-ref sweep-params "Dir"))) }

  apps-dir : ShellExpr = SePathJoin (SeVar "Repo") (SeConcat (SeLit "apps\\") (pipe-param-ref sweep-params "Dir"))

  files-art : PipeArtifact = PipeArtifact { pa-name = "files", pa-kind = PkValue, pa-expr = SeVar "files", pa-from = Just (SeAsArray (SePipe (SeListFiles apps-dir "*.codex" True) [StSortBy "FullName"])) }

  pass-art : PipeArtifact = PipeArtifact { pa-name = "pass", pa-kind = PkValue, pa-expr = SeVar "pass", pa-from = Just (SeInt 0) }

  diag-art : PipeArtifact = PipeArtifact { pa-name = "diag", pa-kind = PkValue, pa-expr = SeVar "diag", pa-from = Just (SeInt 0) }

  crash-art : PipeArtifact = PipeArtifact { pa-name = "crash", pa-kind = PkValue, pa-expr = SeVar "crash", pa-from = Just (SeInt 0) }

  timeout-art : PipeArtifact = PipeArtifact { pa-name = "timeout", pa-kind = PkValue, pa-expr = SeVar "timeout", pa-from = Just (SeInt 0) }

  crashes-art : PipeArtifact = PipeArtifact { pa-name = "crashes", pa-kind = PkValue, pa-expr = SeVar "crashes", pa-from = Just (SeArrayLiteral []) }

  sweep-arts : List PipeArtifact = [repo-art, compile-script-art, stage0-art, seed-cdx-art, out-dir-art, files-art, pass-art, diag-art, crash-art, timeout-art, crashes-art]

Section: S01 -- Preamble

  s01-body : List ShellCmd = [ScSetStrictMode, ScSetErrorStop, ScBlank, pipe-produce repo-art, ScSetLocation (pipe-ref sweep-arts sweep-params "Repo")]

  s01 : PipeStage = PipeStage { ps-name = "preamble", ps-why = "resolve the repository root and run from it", ps-in = [], ps-out = [repo-art], ps-needs = [], ps-verdict = [], ps-body = s01-body }

Section: S02 -- Stage0 Setup

  s02-body : List ShellCmd = [ScBlank, pipe-produce compile-script-art, pipe-produce stage0-art, pipe-produce seed-cdx-art, ScMkdir (SePathParent (pipe-ref sweep-arts sweep-params "stage0")), ScCopy (pipe-ref sweep-arts sweep-params "seedCdx") (pipe-ref sweep-arts sweep-params "stage0")]

  s02 : PipeStage = PipeStage { ps-name = "stage0 setup", ps-why = "put the depot seed where compile.ps1 will find it, so the sweep grades the seed", ps-in = [], ps-out = [compile-script-art, stage0-art, seed-cdx-art], ps-needs = [], ps-verdict = [], ps-body = s02-body }

Section: S03 -- Output Directory

  s03-body : List ShellCmd = [ScBlank, pipe-produce out-dir-art, ScIf (SeDirExists (pipe-ref sweep-arts sweep-params "outDir")) [ScDeleteTree (pipe-ref sweep-arts sweep-params "outDir")] [], ScMkdir (pipe-ref sweep-arts sweep-params "outDir")]

  s03 : PipeStage = PipeStage { ps-name = "output directory", ps-why = "an empty directory per sweep, so a stale log cannot be read as this run's", ps-in = ["Repo", "Dir"], ps-out = [out-dir-art], ps-needs = [], ps-verdict = [], ps-body = s03-body }

Section: S04 -- Discover Files

  s04-body : List ShellCmd = [ScBlank, pipe-produce files-art, ScEcho (SeConcat (SeConcat (SeConcat (SeLit "Sweep: ") (SeCount (pipe-ref sweep-arts sweep-params "files"))) (SeLit " files under apps/")) (pipe-ref sweep-arts sweep-params "Dir"))]

  s04 : PipeStage = PipeStage { ps-name = "discover files", ps-why = "every chapter under the named apps directory, in a stable order", ps-in = ["Repo", "Dir"], ps-out = [files-art], ps-needs = [], ps-verdict = [], ps-body = s04-body }

Section: S05 -- Counters

  s05-body : List ShellCmd = [ScBlank, pipe-produce pass-art, pipe-produce diag-art, pipe-produce crash-art, pipe-produce timeout-art, pipe-produce crashes-art]

  s05 : PipeStage = PipeStage { ps-name = "counters", ps-why = "the four tallies and the list of what went wrong", ps-in = [], ps-out = [pass-art, diag-art, crash-art, timeout-art, crashes-art], ps-needs = [], ps-verdict = [], ps-body = s05-body }

Section: S06 -- Sweep Loop

  proc-exit : ShellExpr = SeProperty (SeVar "proc") "ExitCode"

  s06-timeout : List ShellCmd = [ScStopProcess (SeProperty (SeVar "proc") "Id"), ScEchoStyled (SeConcat (SeLit "  TIMEOUT  ") (SeVar "rel")) ClBrightRed True, ScIncrement "timeout", ScAppend "crashes" (SeConcat (SeConcat (SeLit "TIMEOUT") SeTab) (SeVar "rel")), ScContinue]

  crash-label : ShellExpr = SeConcat (SeConcat (SeLit "CRASH(") proc-exit) (SeLit ")")

  s06-crash : List ShellCmd = [ScEchoStyled (SeConcat (SeConcat crash-label (SeLit "  ")) (SeVar "rel")) ClBrightRed True, ScIncrement "crash", ScAppend "crashes" (SeConcat (SeConcat crash-label SeTab) (SeVar "rel"))]

  s06-exit-check : List ShellCmd = [ScIf (SeIntEq proc-exit (SeInt 0)) [ScIncrement "pass"] [ScIf (SeIntEq proc-exit (SeInt 4)) [ScIncrement "diag"] s06-crash]]

  compile-args : List ShellExpr = [SeLit "-NoProfile", SeLit "-File", pipe-ref sweep-arts sweep-params "CompileScript", SeLit "-Src", SeProperty (SeVar "f") "FullName", SeLit "-Out", SeVar "cdxOut", SeLit "-Log", SeVar "logOut"]

  s06-body-inner : List ShellCmd = [ScAssign "name" (SeProperty (SeVar "f") "BaseName"), ScAssign "rel" (SeSubstringFrom (SeProperty (SeVar "f") "FullName") (SeAdd (SeTextLength (pipe-ref sweep-arts sweep-params "Repo")) (SeInt 1))), ScAssign "cdxOut" (SePathJoin (pipe-ref sweep-arts sweep-params "outDir") (SeConcat (SeVar "name") (SeLit ".cdx"))), ScAssign "logOut" (SePathJoin (pipe-ref sweep-arts sweep-params "outDir") (SeConcat (SeVar "name") (SeLit ".log"))), ScBlank, sh-start-process-stderr "proc" (SeLit "pwsh") compile-args (SePathJoin (pipe-ref sweep-arts sweep-params "outDir") (SeConcat (SeVar "name") (SeLit ".stderr"))), ScAssign "exited" (SeMethodCall (SeVar "proc") "WaitForExit" [SeMul (pipe-ref sweep-arts sweep-params "TimeoutSec") (SeInt 1000)]), ScIf (SeNot (SeVar "exited")) s06-timeout [], ScBlank, ScSequence s06-exit-check]

  s06-body : List ShellCmd = [ScBlank, ScForEach "f" (pipe-ref sweep-arts sweep-params "files") s06-body-inner]

 ONE GUEST AT A TIME: the loop waits on each compile before starting the next,
 so `-Jobs` names a number this script never uses and the sweep holds a single
 guest however many files it finds.

  s06 : PipeStage = PipeStage { ps-name = "sweep loop", ps-why = "compile each chapter under the staged seed and sort the outcome into pass, diagnostic halt, crash or timeout", ps-in = ["files", "CompileScript", "outDir", "Repo", "TimeoutSec"], ps-out = [], ps-needs = [PrGuests 1], ps-verdict = [], ps-body = s06-body }

Section: S07 -- Summary

  s07-crashes : List ShellCmd = [ScEcho (SeLit "Crashes/timeouts:"), ScForEach "c" (pipe-ref sweep-arts sweep-params "crashes") [ScEcho (SeConcat (SeLit "  ") (SeVar "c"))]]

  results-line : ShellExpr = SeConcat (SeConcat (SeConcat (SeConcat (SeConcat (SeConcat (SeConcat (SeConcat (SeLit "Results: ") (SeCount (pipe-ref sweep-arts sweep-params "files"))) (SeLit " files, ")) (pipe-ref sweep-arts sweep-params "pass")) (SeLit " compiled, ")) (pipe-ref sweep-arts sweep-params "diag")) (SeLit " diagnostic-halt, ")) (pipe-ref sweep-arts sweep-params "crash")) (SeLit " crash")

  s07-body : List ShellCmd = [ScBlank, ScEcho (SeLit ""), ScEcho (SeConcat (SeConcat (SeConcat results-line (SeLit ", ")) (pipe-ref sweep-arts sweep-params "timeout")) (SeLit " timeout")), ScIf (SeIntGt (SeCount (pipe-ref sweep-arts sweep-params "crashes")) (SeInt 0)) s07-crashes [], ScExit (SeAdd (pipe-ref sweep-arts sweep-params "crash") (pipe-ref sweep-arts sweep-params "timeout"))]

  s07 : PipeStage = PipeStage { ps-name = "summary", ps-why = "report the four tallies and exit with the number of crashes plus timeouts", ps-in = ["files", "pass", "diag", "crash", "timeout", "crashes"], ps-out = [], ps-needs = [], ps-verdict = [PoComputed "the number of applications whose compile CRASHED, so a caller reads the count and not merely that something failed"], ps-body = s07-body }

Section: Assembly

  sweep-pipe : Pipeline = Pipeline { pl-name = "sweep-apps", pl-doc = "Compile every .codex under apps/ to verify no compiler crashes", pl-params = sweep-params, pl-stages = [PsStage s01, PsStage s02, PsStage s03, PsStage s04, PsStage s05, PsStage s06, PsStage s07] }

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni (emit-powershell (pipeline-to-shell sweep-pipe))
  end

